omes a two-plant upgrade; they face off against an overcomplicated wash plant nicknamed \\\"The Octopus.\\\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qkErMO8WNd0LHRz8PCZYQl3tfIC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-07-11\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2021-01-03\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}